<title>THAILAND: Iran buys 60,000 tonnes Thai rice- traders.</title>
<headline>Iran buys 60,000 tonnes Thai rice- traders.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran bought 60,000 tonnes of 100 percent B grade rice from Thailand for May/August shipments, trade sources said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The purchase was through an Austrian trading firm and the price was quoted at around $330 per tonne FOB Bangkok, they told Reuters.</p>
<p>Iran was still negotiating with the Thai government and traders for the purchase of another 400,000 tonnes of Thai rice, but deal was not concluded yet, they said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
